Title: Flashback Sample

FADE IN:

INT. ARCHIVE - NIGHT

Mara opens drawer twelve.

MARA
Show me the first version.

CUT TO:

INT. ARCHIVE - NIGHT - FLASHBACK

Young Mara labels a drive: MASTER_001.
The jacket is navy, not black.

YOUNG MARA
Do not lose this hash.

DISSOLVE TO:

INT. ARCHIVE - NIGHT - PRESENT

Mara holds the same drive. Jacket is black. A faded navy thread clings to the cuff.

MARA
The wardrobe remembers.

FADE OUT.
